    '喜欢这个工具箱吗？': 'Enjoying CTool?',
    'CTool 完全离线、免费、无广告，也不会上传任何数据。如果它帮你省下过一点时间，欢迎请作者喝杯咖啡，或者看看「底价接活开发」。': 'CTool is fully offline, free and ad-free, and never uploads your data. If it saved you some time, consider buying the author a coffee or taking a look at the dev-for-hire page.',
    '这个提示每天只出现一次，关闭后当天不再打扰。': 'This reminder appears at most once a day. Close it and it stays away for the rest of the day.',
    '去看看': 'Take a look',
