    '请作者喝杯咖啡': 'Buy the author a coffee',
    'CTool 完全离线、免费、没有广告，也不收集任何数据。如果它帮你省下过几分钟，欢迎随手赞赏一下，让这个小工具箱能一直更新下去。': 'CTool is fully offline, free, ad-free and collects no data. If it saved you a few minutes, a small tip helps keep this toolbox updated.',
    '赞赏全凭自愿，不影响任何功能；所有工具永远免费、离线可用。': 'Tipping is entirely optional and unlocks nothing; every tool stays free and offline forever.',
