    'AI 辅助 · 快速交付': 'AI-assisted · Fast delivery',
    '除了这个工具箱，作者也接各类小型开发活儿。用 AI 辅助编码、人工逐项把关，把沟通和试错成本压下来，所以能给出很实在的价格——需求说清楚，就能开工。': 'Besides this toolbox, the author takes on small development gigs. AI-assisted coding plus a careful human review keeps communication and trial-and-error cheap, so the price stays honest — tell me what you need and we can start.',
    '能做什么': 'What I build',
    'Chrome / Edge 浏览器扩展、油猴脚本': 'Chrome / Edge extensions and userscripts',
    '工具站、落地页、后台管理界面等前端项目': 'Tool sites, landing pages, admin dashboards and other front-end work',
    '数据清洗、批量处理、格式转换类小工具': 'Small utilities for data cleaning, batch processing and format conversion',
