    '现有项目改功能、修 Bug、做离线化改造': 'Feature changes, bug fixes and offline-first refactors for existing projects',
    '怎么合作': 'How it works',
    '一句话说清需求、用途和期望效果即可': 'A short description of the goal, use case and expected result is enough',
    '先评估并报一个总价，确认后再动手': 'A fixed quote comes first; work starts only after you approve it',
    '小步交付，过程中随时可看可改': 'Small incremental deliveries, open to review and changes along the way',
    '验收通过后交付源码与简要使用说明': 'Source code and brief usage notes are handed over after acceptance',
    '能用离线方案解决的，不硬塞服务器和订阅': 'If an offline solution works, no server or subscription is pushed on you',
    '为什么划算': 'Why it is affordable',
    '按件报价，不按工时磨洋工': 'Priced per deliverable, not padded billable hours',
    'AI 提速的部分不重复计费，省下的算你的': 'Time saved by AI is not billed twice; the savings are yours',
    '小需求不设起做门槛，几小时能做完就按几小时算': 'No minimum project size; a few hours of work is priced as a few hours',
    '代码可读、无暗桩、不捆绑后续维护': 'Readable code, no hidden hooks, no forced maintenance contracts',
    '默认本地优先，隐私和数据留在你自己手里': 'Local-first by default, so privacy and data stay with you',
    '需求、预算、工期一并写清楚，报价会更准。直接发邮件或加 QQ 联系我，也可以在赞赏时附言简述需求；具体价格一律按需求评估，本页不承诺固定金额。': 'Include the requirements, budget and deadline for an accurate quote. Email me or add me on QQ, or leave a short brief in the tip message. Prices are always scoped per request; this page does not promise a fixed amount.',
    '关于每日提示': 'About the daily reminder',
    '每天首次打开工具箱时提示一次，点关闭后当天不再出现。随时可以从左侧导航回到本页。': 'The reminder shows once on your first visit each day and stays away after you close it. You can always return to this page from the sidebar.',
